  <MOWiki_HomeHint1>Search by name or defName, or narrow the list with the category buttons.</MOWiki_HomeHint1>
  <MOWiki_HomeHint2>The dropdown filters by where things come from: butchering, loot, processing, and so on.</MOWiki_HomeHint2>
  <MOWiki_HomeHint3>Everything is linked. Recipes, creatures, research and factions all have their own pages.</MOWiki_HomeHint3>
  <MOWiki_HomeHint4>Use the arrows at the top left to go back and forward.</MOWiki_HomeHint4>


